---
pagination:
  data: operators
  size: 1
  alias: operator
permalink: "/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/index.html"
layout: base.njk
tags: ["operatorPages"]
ogType: "article"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ operator.name }} Free SC, Offers and Redemption Requirements"
  description: "{{ operator.name }} signup SC, first-purchase offer, redemption minimums and playthrough, with source-linked conditions and published payout terms."
  jsonld:
    "@context": "https://schema.org"
    "@graph":
      - "@type": "Article"
        "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/#article"
        headline: "{{ operator.name }} Offers and Redemption Requirements"
        description: "{{ operator.name }} signup SC, first-purchase offer, redemption minimums and playthrough, with source-linked conditions."
        datePublished: "{{ operator.verifiedAt }}"
        dateModified: "{{ operator.verifiedAt }}"
        mainEntityOfPage: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/"
        author:
          "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/#alex-rowan"
        publisher:
          "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/#org"
      - "@type": "BreadcrumbList"
        itemListElement:
          - "@type": "ListItem"
            position: 1
            name: "Home"
            item: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/"
          - "@type": "ListItem"
            position: 2
            name: "Redemption times"
            item: "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/"
          - "@type": "ListItem"
            position: 3
            name: "{{ operator.name }}"
      - "@type": "FAQPage"
        "@id": "https://socialcasinoindex.com/redemption-times/{{ operator.slug }}/#faq"
        mainEntity:
          - "@type": "Question"
            name: "How long does a {{ operator.name }} redemption take?"
            acceptedAnswer:
              "@type": "Answer"
              text: "Published timing: {{ operator.publishedEstimate }}. First redemption: {{ operator.firstRedemption }}. These are published terms, not measured results; Social Casino Index has not yet completed a funded redemption test with {{ operator.name }}."
          - "@type": "Question"
            name: "What is the minimum redemption at {{ operator.name }}?"
            acceptedAnswer:
              "@type": "Answer"
              text: "Minimum: {{ operator.minRedemption }}. Methods: {{ operator.methods }}."
---
{% from "player-value.njk" import benchmarks %}
<main><article class="wrap py-10">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/redemption-times/">Redemption times</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">{{ operator.name }}</span></li></ol></nav>
  <p class="eyebrow">Operator record · Reviewed {{ operator.verifiedAt | readableDate }}</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">{{ operator.name }} Offers and Redemption Requirements</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ operator.summary }}</p>
  {{ benchmarks(operator, true) }}
  <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Published claims, not measured results. “Not verified” does not mean zero. Offers and eligibility can change.</p>
  <h2>Funded test status</h2>
  <p>
{% if operator.testStatus == "completed" %}
    <span class="badge completed"><i class="ph ph-seal-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Completed funded test</span>
{% elif operator.testStatus == "pending" %}
    <span class="badge pending"><i class="ph ph-hourglass-medium" aria-hidden="true"></i> Funded test pending</span>
{% else %}
    <span class="badge nottested"><i class="ph ph-clock-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i> Not tested yet</span>
{% endif %}
  </p>
{% if operator.testStatus == "completed" and operator.observedResult %}
  <p>We funded an account and timed a real redemption: {{ operator.observedResult.type }} redemption by {{ operator.observedResult.method }}, requested {{ operator.observedResult.requestedAt | readableDate }}, received {{ operator.observedResult.receivedAt | readableDate }} ({{ operator.observedResult.businessDays }} business days){% if operator.observedResult.notes %}. {{ operator.observedResult.notes }}{% endif %}.</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Observed figures come from our own funded test and are shown separately from the operator's published terms below. A single test does not make a ranking; see the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
{% elif operator.testStatus == "pending" %}
  <p>A funded redemption test with {{ operator.name }} is pending. No measured result is available. <a href="/methodology/">How funded testing works</a>.</p>
{% else %}
  <p>We have not funded an account with {{ operator.name }} yet. Every figure on this page is a published term from the operator's own documents, not a measured result. <a href="/methodology/">How funded testing works</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
  <h2>Timing and other terms</h2>
  <dl class="detail-grid">
    <div><dt>Daily reward</dt><dd>{{ operator.playerValue.daily.display }}{% if operator.playerValue.daily.conditions %}. {{ operator.playerValue.daily.conditions }}{% endif %}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Other package notes</dt><dd>{{ operator.packageValue }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Games</dt><dd>{{ operator.games }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>First redemption</dt><dd>{{ operator.firstRedemption }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Repeat redemption</dt><dd>{{ operator.repeatRedemption }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Identity checks</dt><dd>{{ operator.kyc }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Limits</dt><dd>{{ operator.limits }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Support</dt><dd>{{ operator.support }}</dd></div>
  </dl>
  {% if operator.tradeoffs.length %}<h2>Limitations</h2><ul>{% for item in operator.tradeoffs %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>{{ operator.availability }}</p>
  {% if operator.restrictedStates.length %}<p><strong>Existing exclusions retained by the site's state gate:</strong> {{ operator.restrictedStates | join(", ") }}. This list was not reverified in the offer review and does not establish availability elsewhere.</p>{% endif %}
  <p>See how each closed state treats sweepstakes casinos in the <a href="/availability/#closed-states">state availability index</a>.</p>
  <h2>Compare payout methods</h2>
  <p>{{ operator.name }} redemption methods: {{ operator.methods }}. Compare the rails in detail: <a href="/guides/redemption-methods/bank-transfer/">bank transfer</a>, <a href="/guides/redemption-methods/gift-card/">gift card</a> and <a href="/guides/redemption-methods/crypto/">cryptocurrency</a>, or read the <a href="/research/sweepstakes-casino-redemption-times/">full redemption-time research</a>.</p>
  {% if operator.partner %}
  <div class="cta-box" data-cta-operator="{{ operator.slug }}">
    <p class="cta-title">Check {{ operator.name }}</p>
    <p class="cta-msg">Confirm your state and the live offer before creating an account.</p>
    <a class="cta-btn" href="/go/{{ operator.slug }}/">Visit {{ operator.name }} <i class="ph ph-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  <h2 id="sources">Sources and verification</h2>
  <p>
    <span class="badge {% if operator.verificationStatus == 'verified' %}complete{% else %}pending{% endif %}"><i class="ph ph-seal-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ operator.verificationLabel }}</span>
    <span class="badge nottested"><i class="ph ph-clock-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i> Last checked {{ operator.verifiedAt | readableDate }}</span>
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">The review date records the evidence check, not a guarantee that every field was verified. Some public pages were retrieved from a US location to resolve regional access blocks; this does not establish player eligibility. Blocked pages document an evidence gap and do not support numeric claims.</p>
  <ol class="sources">{% for source in operator.sources %}<li id="source-{{ source.id }}">{{ source.label }}. <a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ source.url | replace("https://", "") }}</a>. <span class="accessed">Checked {{ source.accessed | readableDate }}.{% if source.access == "bot_blocked" %} Access blocked.{% elif source.access == "region_notice_only" %} Availability notice only; substantive terms unavailable.{% elif source.access == "login_required" %} Login required; rules not reviewed.{% endif %}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ol>
  <p class="byline mt-8"><a href="/redemption-times/">Compare all operators</a> · <a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a> · <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate disclosure</a></p>
</article></main>
